WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.560
[Mark] Hello everybody! My name is Markiplier,

00:00:01.660 --> 00:00:04.800
and welcome back to "Five Nights At Freddy's: Sister Location".

00:00:04.960 --> 00:00:06.280
Now, earlier today,

00:00:06.280 --> 00:00:08.460
Scott released a patch for the game

00:00:08.460 --> 00:00:10.780
that involved Night Four, because apparently, *SNIFF*

00:00:11.160 --> 00:00:14.520
the springlock section was OBSCENELY difficult,

00:00:14.540 --> 00:00:18.540
but not for ME, because I beat it pre-patch

00:00:18.540 --> 00:00:20.600
and it even said, in the patch notes,

00:00:20.600 --> 00:00:24.000
that I get bragging rights. He didn't call me out specifically,

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:26.300
but I know that I was in his heart when he was thinking about it

00:00:26.300 --> 00:00:30.600
so I get to keep (Royaliplier) my crown upon my head

00:00:30.600 --> 00:00:35.520
and I still, as smelly, and as tarnished, and as slightly sweaty as it may be,

00:00:35.520 --> 00:00:37.520
I get to keep my glorious crown,

00:00:37.600 --> 00:00:40.080
and continue to call myself...

00:00:40.100 --> 00:00:41.900
THE KING...

00:00:41.900 --> 00:00:43.400
of Five Nights at Freddy's.

00:00:43.400 --> 00:00:44.000
(Weirdly pleased noise) mhmmm

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:44.860
Sorry, did I not say that right?

00:00:44.860 --> 00:00:45.360
The ...

00:00:46.400 --> 00:00:47.380
(Painlful kingly expression of kingliness) KING!

00:00:47.380 --> 00:00:49.000
Ow... of Five Nights at Freddy's.

00:00:49.560 --> 00:00:53.580
So I get to be a little proud of that, but I'm sure that my pride will be ripped from my chest

00:00:53.580 --> 00:00:55.580
as soon as I go into Foxy's area

00:00:55.580 --> 00:00:57.580
because I'm pretty sure there's something NEW

00:00:57.580 --> 00:00:59.260
waitin' for me-

00:00:59.260 --> 00:01:00.660
I'd better start this thing. *clank*

00:01:00.660 --> 00:01:03.580
[Female Robotic Voice] Funtime Auditorium Maintenance Vent opened. [Mark] I bet it's not gonna be Foxy.

00:01:03.580 --> 00:01:05.580
