00:01:05.580 --> 00:01:07.580
*Light recharging*

00:01:07.580 --> 00:01:09.580
*Footsteps*

00:01:15.760 --> 00:01:17.000
I don't hear nothing,

00:01:17.100 --> 00:01:20.480
which is usually a bad sign...

00:01:20.480 --> 00:01:22.480
I mean, usually, it's a good sign, but-

00:01:23.600 --> 00:01:24.900
*Flash*
*Light recharging*

00:01:28.780 --> 00:01:35.700
*Footsteps*

00:01:35.700 --> 00:01:39.640
*Marks stressed face*

00:01:40.160 --> 00:01:42.160
