00:09:18.940 --> 00:09:20.400
Oh god, what is that?

00:09:21.840 --> 00:09:25.720
Oh no....*chuckling* OH GOD NO... *chuckling*

00:09:26.240 --> 00:09:28.540
Hey handsome, how you doing there?

00:09:29.540 --> 00:09:31.900
Oh that's.... Ah

00:09:31.900 --> 00:09:36.720
Hi Baby, how are you doing? *chuckling* You enjoying my body? *chuckling* It's very ni-

00:09:36.720 --> 00:09:37.700
NOOO

