00:09:47.740 --> 00:09:55.420
Ok, so I'm gonna get through these- I'm gonna get through these credits,  but you know I might- I might as well take this moment to say that this game is phenomenal.

00:09:55.420 --> 00:10:01.300
I LOVE it, and a lot of people probably are like comparing it to the old Five Nights at Freddy's

00:10:01.300 --> 00:10:03.300
but I think this is exactly what this series needed.

00:10:03.300 --> 00:10:09.660
A paradigm shift in what it is while still keeping the creep universe that it's in.

00:10:09.660 --> 00:10:15.560
I think it captured like the essence and the feel of Five Nights at Freddy's, as opposed to anything else.

00:10:15.560 --> 00:10:22.960
You know, the other ones tried to replicate the formula but this one broke the mold and yet kept the feel of it, which is wonderful.

00:10:22.960 --> 00:10:27.760
But this is not done. Scott, I know you. I know this.

00:10:27.760 --> 00:10:32.680
It doesn't end in the fifth night. I know that. NOOOOO NO GET OUT OF HERE

00:10:32.680 --> 00:10:34.060
GET OUT OF HERE

