OH, look at that. They almost look adorable.

00:11:32.460 --> 00:11:34.220
Oh ho ho ho ho, she's beautiful.

00:11:34.220 --> 00:11:38.160
OH,  *deep breath*, see? See?

00:11:38.160 --> 00:11:44.400
OOH OH Aw man, why so many wires? *chuckling* Why so many wires? *chuckling*

