Ok so, there's go to be something here because this one, I see wires for feet and we kind of saw it in the reflection.

00:11:59.460 --> 00:12:03.880
So this is like the- this is the version of the Endoskeleton.

00:12:03.880 --> 00:12:09.020
Uh- it's like, the other animatronics were- had Endoskeletons and that's what they were

00:12:09.020 --> 00:12:15.840
