and that's apparently what happens there.

00:12:17.440 --> 00:12:23.860
And in the animatronics- or-uh in the spring trap section, this animatronic was on the right.

00:12:23.860 --> 00:12:29.280
Because it had to be looking at Ballora- it had to be pulled over to the left to be scooped- you know how it was.

00:12:29.280 --> 00:12:33.460
So, you were looking at this from this angle which meant you were on the right side of the room.

00:12:33.460 --> 00:12:35.260
So there's something over there.

00:12:35.260 --> 00:12:39.060
Oh and Freddy. Oh Freddy, y-you've looked better Freddy.

